# Camera: orbit and zoom never change the puzzle.
cuboid 3x3x3

case 2.1 Drag empty space right
note Orbit: the cube spins about the vertical; no turn
wait 0.4
drag 60,420 300,420 0.8
wait 0.3
expect camera-moved
expect solved
expect no-feedback turn

case 2.2 Drag empty space up
note Orbit: view tilts so the bottom (D, yellow) comes into view; no turn
drag 60,440 60,240 0.8
wait 0.3
expect camera-moved
expect solved

case 2.3 Keep tilting far past the pole
note Pitch is clamped at 85 degrees; the view never flips over
drag 60,460 60,40 0.8
drag 60,460 60,40 0.8
wait 0.3
expect solved

case 2.4 Right-drag across the cube
note A secondary-button drag orbits even when it starts on a sticker
home
drag F@0,0,2 +200,0 0.8 right
wait 0.3
expect camera-moved
expect solved
expect no-feedback turn

case 2.5 Wheel up, then down
note Zoom in, then out
scroll 3
wait 0.5
scroll -6
wait 0.5
expect camera-moved
expect solved

case 2.6 Wheel far past both limits
note Zoom is clamped between 0.6x and 3x the framing distance
scroll 40
wait 0.5
scroll -80
wait 0.5
scroll 4
wait 0.5
expect solved
